      "filename": "THE CENTRAL BANK OF IRELAND (NEW HEADQUARTER BUILDING ON NORTH WALL QUAY)- ALONG BOTANIC AVENUE (JANUARY 2018)-135339 (27856990779).jpg",
      "title": "File:THE CENTRAL BANK OF IRELAND (NEW HEADQUARTER BUILDING ON NORTH WALL QUAY)- ALONG BOTANIC AVENUE (JANUARY 2018)-135339 (27856990779).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/THE_CENTRAL_BANK_OF_IRELAND_%28NEW_HEADQUARTER_BUILDING_ON_NORTH_WALL_QUAY%29-_ALONG_BOTANIC_AVENUE_%28JANUARY_2018%29-135339_%2827856990779%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:THE_CENTRAL_BANK_OF_IRELAND_(NEW_HEADQUARTER_BUILDING_ON_NORTH_WALL_QUAY)-_ALONG_BOTANIC_AVENUE_(JANUARY_2018)-135339_(27856990779).jpg",
      "width": 7952,
